{"meta":{"id":"tt7366338","type":"series","name":"Chernobyl","imdb_id":"tt7366338","description":"Sigue \"la verdadera historia\" de una de las peores catástrofes provocadas por el hombre y habla de los valientes hombres y mujeres que se sacrificaron para salvar a Europa de un desastre inimaginable. La miniserie se centra en el desgarrador alcance del desastre de la planta nuclear que ocurrió en Ucrania en abril de 1986, revelando cómo y por qué ocurrió, además contando las sorprendentes y notables historias de los héroes que lucharon y cayeron.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt7366338.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/900tHlUYUkp7Ol04XFSoAaEIXcT.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f7kz7QLMMfBnM9sMfri4q6FhuvE.png","genres":["Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2019","released":"2019-05-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"9.3","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["Jared Harris","Stellan Skarsgård","Emily Watson","Paul Ritter","Jessie Buckley","Adam Nagaitis","Sam Troughton","Robert Emms","Con O'Neill","Adrian Rawlins","Alan Williams","David Dencik","Mark Lewis Jones","Ralph Ineson","Barry Keoghan","Alex Ferns","Fares Fares","Michael McElhatton"],"writer":["Craig Mazin","Svetlana Alexievich"],"trailers":[{"source":"P-PwLKFzdYg","type":"Trailer","name":"Chernobyl HBO Trailer español | Teaser | Miniserie 2019 | Sub español","ytId":"P-PwLKFzdYg","lang":"es"},{"source":"s9APLXM9Ei8","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"s9APLXM9Ei8","lang":"en"},{"source":"PMlwjCID3Io","type":"Trailer","name":"Teaser Trailer","ytId":"PMlwjCID3Io","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"P-PwLKFzdYg","title":"Chernobyl HBO Trailer español | Teaser | Miniserie 2019 | Sub español"},{"ytId":"s9APLXM9Ei8","title":"Official Trailer"},{"ytId":"PMlwjCID3Io","title":"Teaser Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"9.3","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt7366338"},{"name":"D