asov, un destacado físico nuclear soviético, y le advierte sobre la amenaza de una segunda explosión que podría devastar el continente.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kVsUEtOOYeLRmABVuZztl4k9onO.jpg","released":"2019-05-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"66 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Tierra, ábrete","overview":"Lyudmilla Ignatenko ignora las advertencias sobre la contaminación de su marido, Legásov crea un plan de descontaminación en el que tiene en cuenta las vidas humanas en juego.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Eje4lD5MWkTdbFdtlHnrHT2kA2.jpg","released":"2019-05-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"64 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"La felicidad de la humanidad","overview":"Valery Legasov y el viceprimer ministro soviético Boris Shcherbina consideran usar vehículos lunares para eliminar los desechos radiactivos, mientras tanto Ulana Khomyuk se enfrenta a obstáculos gubernamentales para determinar la verdad sobre la causa de la explosión.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xV2eVT4ejGhVn9OIMCo4uBOhmCC.jpg","released":"2019-05-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"67 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Vichnaya Pamyat","overview":"Valery Legasov, Boris Shcherbina y Ulana Khomyuk arriesgan sus vidas y reputaciones para exponer la verdad sobre Chernobyl.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mgXm2Y6SOFDHtD5thi2LmS7uQBj.jpg","released":"2019-06-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"73 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:0:23","season":0,"episode":23,"title":"Dentro del Episodio: 1:23:45","overview":"Inside the Episode of 1:23:45","released":"2019-07-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"3 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:0:24","season":0,"episode":24,"title":"Dentro del Episodio: Por favor, mantengan la calma","overview":"Inside the Episode of Please Remain Calm","released":"2019-07-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"3 min"},{"id":"tt7366338:0:25","season":0,"episode":25,"title":"Dentro del Episodio: Tier